      "description": "<p>The judge reminds a creature of the oath they swore to the court. The judge makes an Intimidation check against the target's Will DC. On a success, the target takes a –2 status penalty to Deception checks to Lie for 10 minutes (or a –4 status penalty on a critical success). Regardless of the result, the target is temporarily immune to this ability for 24 hours.</p>",
